{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","一箭封喉"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Deathmark Arrow"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对所有敌人造成伤害，对“衰老”的敌人造成伤害提高并使其眩晕。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Bonnie deals damage to all enemies, with increased damage and a stun effect on those afflicted by Aging."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","波妮射出魔法箭，对每个敌人造成2次180% + 20% ATK伤害。魔法箭对“衰老”的敌人造成伤害提升30%，并使其眩晕，持续3 + 0.25秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Bonnie fires magic arrows, dealing 180% + 20% ATK damage to each enemy twice. The magic arrow deals 30% more damage to enemies afflicted by Aging and stuns them for 3 + 0.25s."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":166,"end":173,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 190% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 200% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 210% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 220% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","黯影衰朽"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Decay's Reach"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使得最靠后的敌人获得“衰老”，降低急速，“衰老”的敌人受到其他魔法伤害时会增强“衰老”的效果。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Bonnie casts the Aging magic on the rearmost enemy, reducing their Haste. Whenever any other allied hero deals magic damage to the enemy afflicted by Aging, the effect is further enhanced."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，波妮对最靠后的敌人施加“衰老”魔法，对其造成150% + 10% ATK伤害并使其降低30点急速，持续到战斗结束，波妮会优先攻击这名敌人。\n每有其他友方英雄对“衰老”的敌人造成魔法伤害，会使其携带的“衰老”魔法进一步增强，额外降低10点急速。同一名友军至多使“衰老”魔法增强1次。通过这个方式，“衰老”魔法至多增强2次，且在增至最强后，使该敌人降低30% + 3%攻击力，并且每1秒受到100% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Bonnie casts the Aging magic on the rearmost enemy, dealing 150% + 10% ATK damage and reducing their Haste by 30 until the battle ends. Bonnie prioritizes attacking this target afflicted by Aging.\nWhenever an allied hero deals magic damage to the enemy afflicted by Aging, the effect is further enhanced, reducing their Haste by an extra 10. Each ally can only trigger the enhancement once, and the Aging magic can be enhanced up to 2 times. Once the Aging effect reaches its maximum stack, the afflicted enemy suffers a 30% + 3% reduction in their ATK and takes 100% ATK damage every 1s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":183,"end":188,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":86,"end":92,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":546,"end":551,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":199,"end":207,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":82,"end":96,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":585,"end":593,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 160% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 170% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至180% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 180% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","流雾飞羽"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Nightfall Shift"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","化为黑雾移动至安全位置。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Bonnie transforms into a black mist and moves to a safe spot."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","化为黑雾移动至4格内安全位置，并发射共6枚飞箭，每一枚对敌人造成35% + 5% ATK伤害，黑雾期间自身处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Bonnie transforms into a black mist, moving to a safe spot within 4 tiles and firing 6 arrows, each dealing 35% + 5% ATK damage to an enemy. While in black mist form, Bonnie is invincible."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":111,"end":116,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":55,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":108,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":177,"end":187,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至40% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 40% + 5% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至45% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 45% + 5% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至50% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt to 50% + 5% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 12% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","衰朽萦心"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Blight Surge"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“衰老”增至最强或“衰老”的敌人被击败时，将“衰老”传染给其他敌人。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","When Aging reaches its maximum stack or an Aged enemy is defeated, the effect spreads to an unafflicted enemy."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“衰老”增至最强或“衰老”的敌人被击败时，使“衰老”传染给最近的1名未“衰老”的敌人，并对被传染的敌人造成260% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Aging reaches its maximum stack or an Aged enemy is defeated, the effect spreads to the nearest 1 unafflicted enemy, dealing 260% ATK damage to each."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":130,"end":138,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“衰老”传染时造成的伤害提高至270% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by the spread of Aging to 270% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“衰老”增至最强或“衰老”的敌人被击败时，传染的敌人数量提升至2名。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","When Aging reaches its maximum stack or an Aged enemy is defeated, the effect spreads to 2 unafflicted enemies."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“衰老”传染时造成的伤害提高至280% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by the spread of Aging to 280% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“衰老”增至最强的敌人受到魔法伤害提高。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","When Aging reaches its maximum stack on an enemy, they take more magic damage."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“衰老”增至最强后，该敌人受到的魔法伤害提高10%，受到终极技能的魔法伤害额外提高20%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When the Aging effect reaches its maximum stack on an enemy, their magic damage taken is increased by 10%, with an extra 20% increase for magic damage taken from Ultimates."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","裂脊骨弓"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Deathsong Recurve"]]}